[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-advance-bd3 5...e6"]
[Name "Advance: 4.Bd3 Bxd3 5.Qxd3 e6 6.f4"]

6. f4 { Props up e5 with another pawn, and leaves e3 and the knight's best diagonals weak. }
6... c5 { The same strike at d4. [%cal Gc5d4] }
7. Nf3 Nc6 { A second attacker on d4. White has no bishop on the light squares left, and e4 and f5 are good squares for Black's pieces. [%cal Gc6d4] } *
